Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Maintainer: Mikehenrytech <12794741+Mikehenrytech@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Profile-based launcher for Strix pentests
 Strix Runner is a profile-based CLI for launching authorized Strix
 pentests. It stores global paths and named application profiles in JSON,
 validates them, and runs Strix commands without invoking a shell.
